        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Pou ta thuanc o, Ngamp’rymeipu, Damcloumeipu Guangc ta!",
            "Abumaengcle, Pou ta thuanc o, Kamei nang ringcbamv e!",
            "He chumei guay, kalumpui kai khou guang o;",
            "Neihlaana Kata thuanc ’chamc kho!",
            "",
            "2 Pou ta thuanc o, ramh guay ruc khou Kamei guanghtu bam e,",
            "Kaswkaeng khou nang ta gayna tiiduplou, makavlou!",
            "Nang thay mak cho, nang khang guang nimei guay 3>|",
            "Kachwn thei layna tiiloumei?",
            "",
            "3 Pou ta thuanc o, gaymei ningting >|3 nang ta damclou e!",
            "Pumh gay tiilou, zianpui baanc >|3 nang ta zaylou, gaeklou;",
            "Ryanra ganv ’thuic kaswkaeng >|3 sungclouna",
            "Nang ta azuh tiigaylou tha?",
            "",
            "4 Pou ta thuanc o, he akhou naimei kaguayle, thuanc o!",
            "Kalungp’rik guay Kahu khou guang geicna Kata thuanc o!",
            "Amen! kauc diu, Kamei nunc thuanc kaluaih diu!",
            "Kanganv maekna aniu thuanc ni!"
          ]
        }
      },
